# D3-TR-007: Mineral dissolution supplies an outlet even with a solute-free inlet
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 20mL
add v1 gypsum 0.001mol
add v2 water 20mL
